@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

# Internal operations. The jobs run on their own (rebalance every 5 minutes,
# closing at 18h Brasília); these requests trigger them by hand.

### Invariants: balances, target and whether every rule holds now (status OK or ATTENTION)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/invariants

### Rebalance Instant Payments now
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/rebalance

### Run today's closing now (once per day; a second call returns alreadyClosed = true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/close-of-day
